# Mindgrove AES driver

config CRYPTO_MINDGROVE_AES
	bool "Mindgrove AES hardware accelerator"
	depends on CRYPTO
	depends on HAS_DTS
	help
	  Enable the Mindgrove hardware AES accelerator driver.

	  Features:
	  - AES-128 / AES-192 / AES-256
	  - ECB, CBC, CFB, OFB, CTR modes
	  - Polling-based synchronous operation
	  - Thread-safe via mutex

	  Limitations:
	  - No async support
	  - No PSA Crypto integration
	  - No secure key storage
